  "text": "CREATE\nViral Clip Studio\n🔈\nExplain This Tab\nThulani Mtshwelo\ntmtshwelo21@gmail.com\nAutoPromote\nCreator workspace\nOverview\n\nCREATE\n\nCam Combiner\nFind Viral Clips\nViral Clip Studio\nSmart Promo\nIdea-to-Video\n\nPUBLISH\n\nPublisher\nQueue\n\nMEASURE\n\nAnalytics\n\nSETTINGS\n\nConnections\nTeam\nBilling\nSecurity\nNeed help getting started?\nVisit the docs →\nSign out\nCREATE\nViral Clip Studio\n\nEdit detected moments on the full timeline, refine hooks, and render short clips.\n\nA\nAutoPromote\nVIRAL CLIP STUDIO\nStudio shared-state 20261008\nQuick\nCreator\nSignature\n● Local edit active\n● No render credits used\n↶ Undo\n↷ Redo\n×\n✦\nMoments\n✂\nCut\n⌁\nHook\n⌗\nReframe\nCC\nCaptions\nT\nGraphics\n◆\nMotion\n◫\nComposite\n✺\nCreator FX\n≋\nPacing\n▣\nB-roll\n◐\nColor\n♫\nSound\n⇧\nExport\nPreview\nBefore\nAfter\nCompare\nⅡ\nShow media\nHide timeline\nView options\n↻ Preview synced\n♪ Source audio on\nLoading edited preview…\n❚❚\n0:6.28 / 0:12.0\n🔊\n100%\nMotion controls\n\nEdit a motion graphic’s text, timing and keyframes. Use the playhead to check its entrance, movement and exit.\n\nAI CREATIVE DIRECTOR\nReturn to story direction\n☷\nMotion + sound\n3D Motion\nLogo & layers\n🎯 Viral Punch-Ins\nTransform keyframes\nEditable 3D on your timeline\n3D Motion Director\n\nBuild the scene live. Generate a high-quality preview only when you want to check the final finish.\n\nCinematic 3D Title\nAdd at playhead\nNeon Logo Reveal\nAdd at playhead\nChrome Lyric Burst\nAdd at playhead\nAudio-Reactive 3D Text\nAdd at playhead\nFloating Social Callout\nAdd at playhead\nImpact Word Explosion\nAdd at playhead\nSpeaker Introduction\nAdd at playhead\n3D Comparison Card\nAdd at playhead\nScene continuity\n4.00–7.00s\nCinematic 3D Title\nBasic\nAdvanced\nMain text\nSupporting line\nMaterial\nchrome\nglass\nneon\ngold\nmatte\nholographic\nEntrance\ndolly\norbit\nburst\npulse\nfloat\nslide\nfade\nPrimary colour\nGlow colour\nStart (s)\nEnd (s)\nMotion intensity · 65%\nUpload logo / image (PNG, JPEG, WebP; 5 MB)\n\nSeveral advanced settings are not reflected in the rendered clip. Font, weight, scene easing, audio response, light direction, shadows, reflections, background and quality do not change it. Scene fade opacity is also missing from the rendered clip. 3D output is capped at 720p and 30 fps; check the generated preview before export.\n\nFont family\nstudio\nsans\nserif\nWeight\nregular\nbold\nblack\nAlignment\nleft\ncenter\nright\nEasing\nease out\nease in out\nspring\nlinear\nHold\nstill\nfloat\npulse\norbit\nExit\nfade\ndolly\nspin\nburst\nBackground\ntransparent\ndark\nlight\nQuality\ndraft\npreview\nhigh\nX (%)\nY (%)\nZ\nScale\nRotate X\nRotate Y\nRotate Z\nExtrusion\nBevel\nLine spacing\nFocal length\nCamera motion\nLight direction\nLight intensity\nBloom\nAudio response\nLayer order\nSecondary colour\nLight colour\nShadows\nReflections\nEnabled\nAdd pose keyframe at 6.28s\nNo custom pose keyframes. The preset animation remains fully active.\nDuplicate\nReset preset\nDelete\nGenerate HQ 3D Preview\n✓\n\nOpened “Studio shared-state 20261008” with editable layers.\n\nSplit\nTrim Start\nTrim End\nMore actions\nV\nSelect\nC\nRazor\nB\nRipple\nN\nRoll\nY\nSlip\nU\nSlide\nH\nHand\nShow empty tracks\n⌁ Snap\n⛓ Linked\n⇥ Ripple\n−\n+\nFit\n1×\n0:00\n0:02\n0:04\n0:06\n0:08\n0:10\n0:12\nV1\nSource video\n◉\n□\npodcast-12s.mp4\n12.0s\nG1\nGraphics\n◉\n□\nShared project state\nG2\nMotion + sound\n◉\n□\n✨\nScene continuity\nA2\nOriginal audio\n◉\n□\nM\nS\npodcast-12s.mp4 audio\nFX\nSound effects\n◉\n□\nM\nS\nspeech\nSelect Tool\nMagnetic Snapping\nAudio/Video Linked\n0:06",
